'''Mallow''' (Japanese: '''マオ''' ''Mao'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Heal all damage from 1 of your {{TCGP|Shiinotic}} or {{TCGP|Tsareena}}. If you do, discard all Energy from that Pokémon.
}}

