==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Max Potion}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. However, the TCG card is an {{TCGP|Item card}} rather than a {{TCGP|Supporter card}}, and it can be used on any Pokémon rather than specifically Shiinotic or Tsareena.
** {{TCG|Mallow}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Mallow]] is the [[Trial Captain|captain]] of [[Akala Island]]'s [[Lush Jungle]], which is featured in the illustration.

